Modifications by Innovo:
- Renamed the integration domain to innovo_solar_edge.
- Added energy.py and date.py: an energy and solar-performance model
  (derived power flows, daily totals and cost, PVWatts-based typical output,
  efficiency, health trend and cleaning recommendation, editable system
  settings), wired into __init__.py, sensor.py, number.py and the options flow.
- Added provision.py and services.yaml: an action and button that configure
  the Home Assistant Energy dashboard and build a Solar & Energy dashboard.
- Added tariff.py: electricity rate plans (time-of-use seasons, tiers, export
  credit, price override) editable in a new options-flow menu step and through
  set_tariff / set_tariff_rates actions; the options form moved to a
  "settings" step behind that menu.
- Added snapshot.py and image.py: a 720x720 PNG dashboard image rendered every
  60 s, exposed as an image entity and optionally as a file under /local.
- Child devices are linked to the inverter with via_device_id (registered in
  __init__.py) instead of the deprecated via_device.
